      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "Growth is the top line: notes should climb and the Inbox should not. **Inbox backlog** amber at 5, red at 10 - that is you owing the vault an hour.\n\n**Health findings** are the freshness and link linters. Errors are broken things; warnings are ageing things. The job strip at the bottom is the same data as Machinery, filtered to the vault jobs."
